---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<Legal
  title="Cancellation, No-Show & Travel Policy"
  path="/cancellation"
  description="IV Salt Rejuvenation appointment cancellation, no-show, appointment readiness, and travel fee policy for the Treasure Coast."
>
  <p>
    We hold each appointment time exclusively for you and travel to your location, so the following policy
    helps us serve everyone fairly. By booking, you agree to these terms.
  </p>

  <h2>Cancellation Policy</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Appointments canceled with at least <strong>24 hours' notice</strong> may be rescheduled without penalty.</li>
    <li>Appointments canceled with <strong>less than 24 hours' notice</strong> may be subject to a ${site.depositAmount} cancellation fee.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Same-Day Cancellations</h2>
  <p>Appointments canceled on the day of service may be charged up to <strong>50% of the scheduled service cost</strong>.</p>

  <h2>No-Show Policy</h2>
  <p>
    No-show appointments may be charged <strong>100% of the reserved service fee</strong>. Future appointments
    may require prepayment.
  </p>

  <h2>Appointment Readiness</h2>
  <p>
    Clients are responsible for being present at the agreed-upon appointment location at the scheduled time.
    If the client is unavailable upon arrival, IV Salt Rejuvenation LLC will make reasonable efforts to
    contact the client. If the client cannot be reached within <strong>15 minutes</strong> of arrival, the
    appointment may be considered a no-show and applicable fees may apply.
  </p>

  <h2>Travel Fee Policy</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>No travel fee applies within <strong>Port St. Lucie, Stuart, Palm City, and Jensen Beach</strong>.</li>
    <li>Extended service areas may incur an additional travel fee, disclosed prior to appointment confirmation.</li>
    <li>Once the provider has departed for the appointment location, any applicable travel fee is non-refundable.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Deposits</h2>
  <p>
    A ${site.depositAmount} deposit is required to confirm each appointment and is applied toward your treatment
    cost. The deposit may be forfeited for late cancellations or no-shows as described above. For multiple
    guests, a separate deposit applies per person.
  </p>

  <p class="callout">
    You will review and acknowledge this policy as part of your consent form before treatment. Questions? Contact
    us any time at <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a> or <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
  </p>
</Legal>
